rating  everything behind the scenes and he  could be binding his time and waiting  for the right moment to reveal himself  or he could already be dead we can't  know for sure but i'm definitely excited  to find out more about this eldest  brother  now in the xenon flashback we see a  young xenon being bullied by the other  kids because of how creepy his bone  magic looks but then another boy appears  and this boy saves xenon from the  bullies he says so what if his magic is  different and once the bullies run away  he introduces himself to xenon the boy's  name is alan and he looks a lot and i  mean a lot like asta and not only does  this allen guy look a lot like costa he  also acts like asta and has similar  ambitions he wants to protect the people  and help his country which is currently  facing numerous forms of hardships from  harsh climates to frequent wars alan  wants to save the people by becoming the  commanding officer of the mage defense  force which seems to be the spate  kingdom's equivalent of the wizard king  little xenon then declares that he also  wants to become the wizard king or i  mean the commanding officer of the mage  defense force and the two kids xenon and  alan become friendly rivals the  parallels between these two and yuno and  asta are very clear and very deliberate  throughout the chapter the two boys  spend the next few years training and  after they receive their grimoires xenon  tells his brother that he is no longer  interested in becoming a devil host  instead he and allen joined the fourth  division of the mage defense forces soon  after they join a new dungeon appears  within the spade kingdom and xenon and  allen along with other mages are sent  out on an official mission to explore  the dungeon unfortunately this was no  ordinary dungeon an actual devil was  sealed inside of it and many of the  defense force members who were sent to  the dungeon lost their lives because of  this overpowered devil despite having  powerful magi